## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/sapintegrationsuite_integration_flow_deployment/import.sh" }}

The ID is `<package_id>/<flow_id>`. The deployed version and status are read from the runtime.
`redeploy_triggers` is not known to SAP, so a configuration that sets it redeploys once on the
first apply.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** deploying and undeploying are asynchronous and take from seconds to several minutes.
  SAP's runtime API reports one deployment per flow ID; it has no notion of several deployed
  versions side by side.
- **Provider:** Edge Integration Cell targeting through `runtime_location_id` is not supported
  and has not been tested; leave it unset. Deployments to the Integration Cell are not
  supported.

